    "xtu_rich_content_e4i7PF": {
      "type": "xtu-rich-content",
      "blocks": {
        "paragraph_LLX6Rj": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "XTU Waterproof Case for S7 Pro/S7 Pro Max Action Camera, 98FT/30M Underwater Housing with Waterproof Charging Cable, Protective Diving Case for Snorkeling, Surfing, Kayaking and Outdoor Recording",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 22,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_7qtUd3": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Designed for XTU S7 Pro/S7 Pro Max</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_QhRLdF": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>This waterproof housing is specially designed for the<a href=\"https://xtucam.com/products/xtu-s7-pro-4k-action-camera\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://xtucam.com/products/xtu-s7-pro-4k-action-camera\"> XTU S7 Pro</a> and <a href=\"https://xtucam.com/products/xtu-s7-pro-max-action-camera\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://xtucam.com/products/xtu-s7-pro-max-action-camera\">S7 Pro Max</a> action cameras, providing a secure fit and dependable protection against water, rain, splashes, dust, and challenging outdoor conditions. Please note that the camera is sold separately.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_YNjjqN": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Waterproof Up to 98FT/30M</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_wMJDYd": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>When correctly installed and fully sealed, the housing protects your camera underwater at depths of up to 98 ft/30 m. It is ideal for diving, snorkeling, swimming, surfing, kayaking, fishing, and other water-based activities.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_dmRJMK": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Waterproof Charging Cable Included</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "paragraph_HLtm3A": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "The included waterproof charging cable allows the camera to connect to a compatible external power source for extended recording in rainy, wet, or splash-prone environments. It is a practical solution for long motorcycle rides, cycling trips, fishing, time-lapse recording, and other outdoor adventures.",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_7pNYeD": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Clear Lens Window for Quality Recording</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_bxxgpd": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>The transparent housing and high-clarity round lens window provide an unobstructed shooting view while protecting the camera body. Capture underwater and outdoor footage without unnecessarily compromising image clarity.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_nfycYk": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4>Ideal for a Wide Range of Activities</h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_kngPrF": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<ul><li>Diving and snorkeling</li><li>Swimming and surfing</li><li>Kayaking and paddleboarding</li><li>Fishing and boating</li><li>Rainy-day cycling</li><li>Motorcycle and helmet recording</li><li>Outdoor time-lapse recording</li><li>Wet, muddy, or dusty environments</li></ul>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_3ECzBp": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4>Installation and Sealing Guide</h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "image_KxEX3H": {
          "type": "video",
          "settings": {
            "video_source": "youtube",
            "video_url": "https://youtu.be/eIGsAMVltNo",
            "media_ratio": "16 / 9",
